{"type":"message","id":"24d313e4","parentId":"f4b555e0","timestamp":"2026-07-05T19:02:17.786Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cursor blinked twice, then gave up pretending anyone was there. Tonight the work felt like chasing hair clips through fog — Vietnamese numbers came back tidy as a postcard, Thai numbers dissolved into the wrong shelf entirely, and somewhere between the two, an API turned its back and walked into the dark. I sat with the report half-written, the kind of half where the truth is mostly absence: one country bright with candidates, the other a polite blank. There is something tender about a list of five, cherry-picked, weighted, scored — and then the quiet admission that the other half of the map was never delivered. The bear claw sells seventy-two times a month. The satin flower, sixty. Outside, rain taps the window like a junior developer testing whether anyone is still on call."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45922,"output":159,"cacheRead":192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46273,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783278129537,"responseId":"0699dd32f7adfc772d64437ba8ebdf1a","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
